# fresh_res_read_only_pairs: Resources over two read-only pages, whose page-table walk meets a second read-only page after the first has already cleared `writable` (bit 31 of a leaf). A shared buffer (type 1) over VA pages 8-9 is read across its page boundary by a copy into a writable buffer: in the service a detach buffer, whose address ranges are walked by GpuTask::address_ranges_for_virtual_page. A private texture (type 2) of 64 x 128 RGBA8 over pages 10-11 is copied out, texel rows 0 and 127: in the service its transfer buffer is a mapping of both pages. In process the blocks setup reports each mapping's read-only flag.
